// A HALF value whose register is written again by later lane inserts.
// The appended writes must stay in the SAME bank as the writes before
// them: an R-view write into a register holding packed half data is
// read back as float by the conversion at the end - the inverse of the
// float-base defect, and just as wrong (codex, second review round).
half4 main(half4 p : TEXCOORD0) : COLOR
{
	half4 a = p;
	a.xy = p.zw;
	a.zw = p.xy;
	return a;
}
